    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52656" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλλι-θριξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐχος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with beautiful
			manes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλίτριχας ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.323
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.475
			</span></i>, etc.; of sheep, <i>with fine wool</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλίτριχα μῆλα νομεύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.336
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				469
			</span></i>: in late Prose, <i>with beautiful hair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλίθριξ</span></b> , <i>waterwort, Asplenium trichomanes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.132
			</span></i>.</div>
